  "description": "A small deserted island, followed by a civil servant who managed the lighthouse of Guldeok Island. One day when he was killing time at the peaceful and boring lighthouse as usual, he saw a strange barnacle coming out from the cuticle of the black sea bream that was given by a close fisherman. and after that…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=792277), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8272831)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/SUSPENSE/tenghu/list?title_no=2150), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/thriller/les-anatifes/list?title_no=4454)",
